  {
    "mode": "single",
    "stem": "A geometric sequence has $b_1=10^{-2.2}$ and ratio $q=10^{0.3}$. Which complete report gives its nth-term rule and $(b_{10},b_7,b_{13})$, with each requested term written to two decimal places? Combine exponents before rounding.\n\n2010 Bradis Table XIV tool excerpt, not a 1978 reproduction:\n\n| m | Main column | Digits |\n|---|---|---|\n| ,40 | 0 | 2512 |\n| ,50 | 0 | 3162 |\n| ,60 | 0 | 3981 |",
